### Promise<T> - Integration

#### works with match expressions on state

- Verify: works with match expressions on state


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 12 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: works with match expressions on state")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val p = make_resolved(100)
var matched = false

match p.state:
    case PromiseState.Resolved(v):
        matched = true
    case _:
        matched = false

expect matched
```

</details>

