Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: works with match expressions for rejection")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val p = make_rejected("error")
var matched = false

match p.state:
    case PromiseState.Rejected(e):
        matched = true
    case _:
        matched = false

expect matched
```

</details>

#### executor receives both callbacks

- Verify: executor receives both callbacks


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

